{"nodes": [{"id": "supabase_tests_transport_test_transport_test", "label": "transport_test (cards ^ref-22, ^ref-23)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "supabase/tests/transport_test.sql", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Failure-case suite for fn_create_transport_run, fn_dispatch_transport_line, fn_confirm_transport_receipt, fn_allocate_freight and the three transport views, TC-05 ... TC-37, TC-39 and TC-40 of TDD-transport.md. Asserts: a run cannot be created by an L2, an L3 or a deactivated Owner (ADR-004, R31); the allocation method is frozen on the run rather than chosen by the caller or re-read from config later, so a July config change cannot move a March number (R29, BR23); a return run cannot be created for lots nobody scheduled a pickup for (R26, BR17); a dispatch leaves the in-transit tuple at the right end (Seam 1); a retry posts no second TRANSFER_OUT (Seam 2, R4); a partial receipt is not treated as a full one (D06); a variance past threshold cannot be signed off with no reason (UAT-11, BR12); a branch admin cannot sign for another branch or for the chef house; rounded freight shares sum exactly to the fare (R24, Seam 3); and an L3 session reads no fare (R20, R34). TC-41 needs two sessions and lives in transport_concurrency_test.sh."}], "edges": [{"source": "supabase_tests_transport_test_transport_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_create_transport_run_fn_create_transport_run", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/transport_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supabase_tests_transport_test_transport_test", "target": "supabase_functions_fn_dispatch_transport_line_fn_dispatch_transport_line", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "supabase/tests/transport_test.sql", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "supab